	"nodes":[
		{"id":"header","type":"text","text":"# 🎯 Poker Second Brain — Dashboard\n**Phase 1 of 3 — Internalize Tony + MOP**   |   Target: Complete all 7 spots → ~100k hands → DB Review","x":-660,"y":-760,"width":1760,"height":80,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"schedule","type":"text","text":"## 📅 Weekly Schedule\n\n| Day | Play | Study |\n|---|---|---|\n| MON | — | — (Badminton 18–20) |\n| TUE | 19:30–20:30 | **17:30–19:30 Deep Study** |\n| WED | — | — (Travel) |\n| THU | 17:30–18:30 | 17:30 /recall 15min |\n| FRI | 20:00–21:30 | **17:30–19:00 Ingest** |\n| SAT | 9:00–10:45 | 10:45–12:00 Hand Review |\n| SAT | 13:00–15:00 | 15:00–16:00 Approve+Prep |\n| SAT | 19:00–20:00 | — (Plyometrics 16–18) |\n| SUN | 9:30–10:30 | **10:30–12:00 Week Review** |\n\n**~8h15m play / ~7h45m study per week**","x":-660,"y":-640,"width":560,"height":420,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"spot-pipeline","type":"text","text":"## 🎓 Spot Pipeline — Tony Clips\n\n| # | Spot | Status |\n|---|---|---|\n| 1 | SRP IP PFR BU vs BB | 🔄 Active |\n| 2 | BB defend vs BU cbet | 🔄 Partial |\n| 3 | Turn probe BU vs BB | ⬜ Next |\n| 4 | BBvSB facing bet+check | ⬜ |\n| 5 | SB cbet T-high + flop | ⬜ |\n| 6 | 3BP OOP PFR SB+BB | 🔄 Partial |\n| 7 | IP defend vs 3bet SB | ⬜ |\n\n**2 weeks per spot = 14 weeks total**\n**Also: MOP course parallel relearn**","x":-60,"y":-640,"width":520,"height":420,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"progress","type":"text","text":"## 📊 Progress Tracker\n\n**Hands played**\nBaseline: ~40,000\nThis week: ___\nRunning total: ___\nTarget (DB Review): 100,000\n\n**Winrate**\nCurrent: -0.5bb/100 (40k hands)\n⚠️ Sample too small — ignore for now\nReassess at: 100k hands\n\n**Phase 1 spots done:** 0 / 7\n\n**Shot-take 500NL when:**\n+2bb/100 over 100k hands at 200NL","x":500,"y":-640,"width":600,"height":420,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"study-rhythm","type":"text","text":"## 📖 Study Rhythm\n\n**TUE 17:30 (2h) — Deep Work**\n→ Watch Tony clip + write raw notes\n\n**THU 17:30 (15min) — Recall**\n→ /recall quiz, log score\n\n**FRI 17:30 (1.5h) — Vault**\n→ /ingest raw notes → /approve draft\n\n**SAT 10:45 (1h15m) — Hands**\n→ Review 3–5 hands → wiki/hands/\n\n**SAT 15:00 (1h) — Admin**\n→ /session-prep + approve drafts\n\n**SUN 10:30 (1.5h) — Week Review**\n→ Update hand count, plan next week","x":-660,"y":-180,"width":520,"height":380,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"coaching-roadmap","type":"text","text":"## 🏆 Coaching Roadmap\n\n**NOW — Phase 1**\nTony private + MOP only\nNo new coach — too many inputs = paralysis\n\n**~Week 14 (Phase 1 end)**\nAll 7 spots in vault + /recall active\n\n**~100k hands (Phase 2)**\nDonk Orleone $500 DB Review\n→ bluffaces.com/coaches/donk-orleone\n→ Requires min 100k hands\n→ Same philosophy as Wakko (MoP E66)\n\n**After audit (Phase 3)**\nIf leaks > existing material:\n→ Donk mentorship $9,600 (24 sessions)\n→ OR Luke Johnson (Clanty) via RIO","x":-60,"y":-180,"width":520,"height":380,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"rules","type":"text","text":"## ⚡ Rules\n\n1. One spot at a time — finish before next\n2. 2+ tables per session for volume\n3. No new course/coach until Phase 2\n4. /session-prep before every session\n5. 500NL only at +2bb/100 / 100k hands","x":500,"y":-180,"width":600,"height":300,"color":"2"},
